{
 "data": {
  "issues": {
   "nodes": [
    {
     "identifier": "KS-1902",
     "title": "check-akto-container-names.sh: a docker flag that takes a value (-u root, -e FOO=1) before an akto container name still passes the guard",
     "state": {
      "name": "Backlog"
     },
     "description": "**BLUF:** `Blockchain/Dev/scripts/check-akto-container-names.sh` still passes a `docker exec` / `docker logs` line whose flag takes a separate value (`-u root`, `-e FOO=1`) before an `akto-` container name, although the line targets slot 1. Pull request 1851 (KS-1866) corrects the flags that carry no separate value; this is the remainder.\n\n* **Cause** (read at the pull request 1851 head `1c73d6ea5d39`): the pattern at `check-akto-container-names.sh:82` is `docker (exec|logs|...)( -[^ ]+)* akto-<name>`. Each `( -[^ ]+)` repeat is one dash-token, so a value token such as `root` or `FOO=1` breaks the chain between the verb and the name.\n* **Measured here** with the real script and a private fixture tree per case (the method of the pull request's own suite; `bash check-akto-container-names.sh <dir>`): `docker exec -it akto-mongo mongosh` rc 1 (flagged, the control); a line with no akto name rc 0 (control); `docker exec -u root akto-mongo mongosh` rc 0; `docker exec -e FOO=1 akto-mongo mongosh` rc 0; `docker exec -it -u root akto-mongo mongosh` rc 0. A pass with rc 0 means the line is NOT reported.\n* **Same class** as `docker logs --tail 5 akto-testing`, which KS-1866 names as not fixed; `-u` and `-e` are the commonly used members.\n* **Searched the board** for `check-akto-container-names`, `docker exec -u`, `akto-mongo`: the hits were KS-1866 (the pull request's own ticket), KS-1609, KS-696, KS-1080, KS-1098; none covers flag values.\n* **Not measured:** GNU/Linux behaviour of the script (macOS BSD grep was used); the real tree (only the fixtures above). Fix shape not chosen here (for example consume a value token after known value-taking flags, or match the container name anywhere on a `docker` line).\n* **Discovered:** 2026-10-31, Seat R 68th, during merge prep of pull request 1851 (gate 50 finding F-851-1); filed on Wednesday's word.",
     "comments": {
      "nodes": []
     }
    }
   ]
  }
 }
}
